bo.", "extract_html": "<p><b>Beruwala</b> is a large town in Kalutara District, Western Province, Sri Lanka, governed by an Urban Council. The town covers a total area of approximately 15\u00a0km<sup>2</sup> (5.8\u00a0sq\u00a0mi) and is located on the south-west coast of Sri Lanka, 60\u00a0km (37\u00a0mi) south of Colombo.</p>"}